- attach an official Glyphchain manifest or signature to modified firmware;
- remove or misrepresent copyright, attribution, or proprietary notices;
- sell, sublicense, or commercially distribute the Materials or modified
  firmware without prior written permission; or
- use the Materials to manufacture or market a competing device or product.

No patent, trademark, trade-secret, or other intellectual-property license is
granted except for the permissions expressly stated above. "Glyphchain" may be
